Why Is Demand Increasing?
Stronger facility security: Organizations are adopting digital tools to improve visitor screening, maintain records, and control access to sensitive locations.
Touchless check-in: Digital pre-registration and self-service kiosks can reduce reception workload and simplify visitor processing.
Integration with security platforms: Connections with access-control systems and identity-verification tools are extending software functionality.

Security Technology Watch: AI-Enabled Visitor Workflows
Visitor management is increasingly connected with broader physical-security and workplace-experience platforms. AI-assisted identity checks, digital approvals, visitor analytics, and automated compliance reporting are creating opportunities for software vendors. Adoption can nevertheless be affected by implementation costs, integration with legacy systems, and privacy concerns related to personal and biometric information.

